    <item>
      <title>OpenBean 0.3.2</title>
      <link>https://github.com/imraywang/openbean/releases/tag/v0.3.2</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 12:34:56 GMT</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>4</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description sparkle:format="markdown" xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[
### Fixed

- **Voice typing no longer cuts off a recording in progress.** If the recorder is already recording — a meeting you started with its button, for example — pressing the voice-typing shortcut now does nothing to the recorder and tells you to stop the recording first. Before, ending the dictation also ended that recording.
- OpenBean only ever ends a recording that it started itself.

### Changed

- This window now shows what is new in an update.
- The "put back into the case" sync trigger is confirmed on hardware: put the recorder back and new recordings download on their own.
- The log now says why an automatic sync did not run.
]]></description>
      <description sparkle:format="markdown" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><![CDATA[
### 修复

- **语音输入不再打断正在进行的录音。** 录音豆正在录音时（比如你按它的按键开始录的会议），按语音输入快捷键不会再对录音豆做任何事，只提示你先停止录音。以前结束语音输入时会把那条录音一起结束掉。
- OpenBean 只会结束它自己开始的录音。

### 变化

- 更新窗口现在会显示新版本的内容。
- 「放回充电盒触发同步」已在真机上确认：把录音豆放回盒子，新录音会自动下载。
- 自动同步没有运行时，日志里会写明原因。
]]></description>
